In a text or in a paragraph the main idea can be stated. Stated means you can put your finger on it. It's there. The writer states it directly. Or it may be implied. Implied means the writer doesn't write it or doesn't express it directly. You just understand it. You just infer it.

801
01:53:16,635 --> 01:53:39,815
